{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">久未於鏡頭前下廚的黃淑儀（GiGi姐）早前在《流行都市》中教煮「蒜蓉牛油白蘭地蝦」。這道菜式香氣撲鼻，即使是用來請客也絕不失禮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ed0e9cc8-1300-4cf0-8ced-a7ae7f82f1d9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XRqIottq1y1788491592.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ed0e9cc8-1300-4cf0-8ced-a7ae7f82f1d9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉牛油白蘭地蝦｜食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>主料：</strong> 牛油、中蝦、蒜蓉、紅椒、蔥花</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>調味：</strong> 白蘭地、鹽、糖</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉牛油白蘭地蝦｜做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"15c8f73a-6664-497a-a2c5-277f8767960c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026r1ImVX2Cwq1788491592.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"15c8f73a-6664-497a-a2c5-277f8767960c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"efc36664-03e0-4a4a-a5de-c29b3e08bc5a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hzui6itsnQ1788491593.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"efc36664-03e0-4a4a-a5de-c29b3e08bc5a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉牛油白蘭地蝦｜實用小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T01:49:53.018938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}